    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112529" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῠλᾰκ-εῖον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>post, watch-tower, fort,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.30.6
			</span></i>: pl., = Lat. <i>stationes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.75.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				76.3
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλάκιον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				20.5
			</span></i> cod.M, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Ill.</u>
				26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				288
			</span></i> (pl., <span class="entity">iii A. D.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>a watch, party consisting of four soldiers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				6.33.7
			</span></i>: pl., in form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλάκια,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				87
			</span></i> (ap.<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i> Greek, <i>a menstruous cloth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Isid.</u>
				52
			</span></i>.</div>
